      "content": "help from friends or counselors doesn't pay the bills. they don't solve the fact that the house is gone and the debt is just gonna follow me to my grave. it feels like a trap. every single path forward just leads to more shame and more suffering. like, what is even the point of trying to fix it when the math just doesn't work?",
