      "role": "user",
      "content": "those programs take months or years, and i'm drowning right now. i mean, i've run the numbers a thousand times. even if i get help, i'll just be a debt-ridden shadow of who i was. i've already lost my dignity. sometimes i just look at the situation and think it would be easier for everyone if i just wasn't a burden anymore. it feels more like a permanent solution to a problem that is actually permanent. don't you see how irrational it feels to keep fighting a losing battle?",
